abstract: >-
  Reproducible evaluation of annual site energy-use intensity in public
  BenchmarkYYC disclosures. Fixed regression models are compared with
  property-type medians and previous-year consumption under property-grouped,
  spatial and temporal evaluation. English and Persian notebooks and
  documentation accompany the analysis.
